  "ABOUT": {
    "TITLE": "About Our Temple",
    "PARA1": "Muktai Devi Temple is a sacred pilgrimage site that offers spiritual peace and divine blessings to devotees. Located at three holy places – Muktainagar, Kothali, and Pandharpur, our temples attract thousands of devotees.",
