  "ABOUT_US": {
    "TITLE": "About Us",
    "SUBTITLE": "History and Spiritual Significance of Shri Muktai Devi Temple",
    "HISTORY_TITLE": "History",
    "HISTORY_PARA_1": "The history of Muktai Devi Temple spans hundreds of years. Muktai Devi was the revered mother of Sant Eknath Maharaj. Due to her devotion and purity, she became worshipped as a form of the Goddess.",
    "HISTORY_PARA_2": "Born in Paithan, Muktai inspired Sant Eknath Maharaj on the path of spirituality. Through her blessings, Sant Eknath Maharaj performed many miracles and brought about social reforms in society.",
    "SPIRITUAL_TITLE": "Spiritual Significance",
    "SPIRITUAL_PARA_1": "Devotees who worship Goddess Muktai attain mental peace, family happiness, and spiritual growth. Her divine blessings remove obstacles and bring positivity into life.",
    "SPIRITUAL_PARA_2": "Especially for women, Goddess Muktai stands as an ideal. Her life of sacrifice, dedication, and devotion is an inspiration for everyone."
  },
